#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Browser agents with a signature"
msgstr "Agentes de IA que compran navegando, con firma"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Observe: check the signature and record it, change nothing"
msgstr "Observar: comprueba la firma y la anota, sin cambiar nada"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Enforce: treat a verified signature as an AI agent so agent rules apply"
msgstr "Aplicar: una firma verificada se trata como agente de IA y le aplican las reglas de agente"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Off: do not check signatures"
msgstr "Desactivado: no comprobar firmas"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "An AI agent that buys by browsing your site looks like a person unless it signs its requests. If the check fails or is slow, the buyer is treated as a person. This setting applies immediately. Enforce takes effect once Trusteed enables full signature verification."
msgstr "Un agente de IA que compra navegando por tu web parece una persona si no firma sus peticiones. Si la comprobación falla o tarda, se le trata como a una persona. Este ajuste se aplica al instante. Aplicar tiene efecto cuando Trusteed activa la verificación completa de firmas."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes guardados."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "WebMCP checkout tools"
msgstr "Herramientas WebMCP del checkout"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Off: do not offer checkout tools to browser agents"
msgstr "Apagado: no ofrecer herramientas de checkout a los agentes de navegador"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "On: browser agents can read and fill the checkout, and your agent rules apply to them"
msgstr "Encendido: los agentes de navegador pueden leer y rellenar el checkout, y se les aplican tus reglas de agente"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Adds tools to the checkout page for AI agents that browse your site. They never place the order or charge: the buyer confirms. This setting applies immediately."
msgstr "Añade herramientas a la página de checkout para los agentes de IA que navegan por tu sitio. Nunca hacen el pedido ni cobran: confirma el comprador. Este ajuste se aplica al instante."

